 "kind": "done",
 "message": "Filed REQ-1001 for Fatima Zahra: Analytics dashboards (BI), routed to manager Marcus Webb for approval (about 1 business day); access isn't granted until they sign off. On your question: Paid time off (POL-PTO-01): Full-time employees accrue 20 days of paid time off per year (1.67 days per month). Up to 5 unused days carry over into the next year; the rest expire on December 31. Interns accrue 1 day per month. Contractors do not accrue PTO. Book PTO in the HR portal; absences of 3 or more consecutive working days need 2 weeks' notice.",
